# Testing

## Backend

- Unit tests use JUnit 5, AssertJ, and Mockito.
- Controller slices use `@WebMvcTest`. Repository tests use `@DataJpaTest`.
- Integration tests use `@SpringBootTest` with Testcontainers PostgreSQL.
- Name tests `methodName_condition_expectedResult`.
- Structure each test as Arrange / Act / Assert. One behaviour per test.
- Cover validation failures and the error response shape, not only happy paths.

## Ticket status machine

- Every valid transition passes. Every invalid transition is rejected.
- Use parameterized tests for the full status × status matrix.

## Frontend

- Component tests use the framework's standard tools (Vitest or Jest plus Testing Library).

## Failures

- Never weaken or delete a failing test to make a build pass. Fix the code or flag the failure.
